# Qwen retrieval contract

- Production retrieval uses `Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B` only.
- Hashing is allowed only as an explicit, recorded fallback.
- Do not register Jina as a retrieval backend.
- Do not encode retrieval queries or documents with Jina.
- Do not replace Qwen vectors with Jina vectors or mix vector spaces.
- Do not change the production retrieval path from experiment code.
- `content_memory` and `style_memory` stay on separate Qwen indices.
